      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Record of testimony which took place before us&mdash;we, the cou[rt]</li>\n<li>(in the) year 4974 of [creation &hellip;]</li>\n<li>here (in) Fus\u1e6d\u0101\u1e6d [Egy]pt, jurisdiction of our lord [the Nagid Abraham, the outstanding Rav, the mighty hammer, light]</li>\n<li>[of the W]est, standard of the Sages, inimitable of the generation and its wonder, from East of the Sun to its West &hellip;]</li>\n<li>&ldquo;From East to West&rdquo; &hellip; [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Renew them in these years&rdquo; &ldquo;May the Lord guard him and preserve him&rdquo; [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>Saadiah b. (his) honor, g(reatness, and) h(oliness, ou)r master Nathan &hellip; [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>language of claims, write and sign and give to [him &hellip;]</li>\n<li>my understanding, in accordance with the desire of my soul, without duress and without [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>from him, 80 Fus\u1e6d\u0101\u1e6d dinars, golden dinars, 49 &hellip; [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>silk, to transact with it, to buy and to &hellip; [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>&ldquo;(If you come with us,) we will extend to you to the same bounty that the Lord [grants us&rdquo; &hellip;]</li>\n<li>and he has 12 dirhems &hellip; in all &hellip; [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>&hellip; [&hellip;]</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
